div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">{{ 'sections.ecom-carbon-cartridges-pair-product.item_title_3_obyhwb3w3en_html' | t }}</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="ec-flex-wp ecom-flex"><div class="core__blocks"><div class="core__blocks"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-arwgjkgij4m"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text ecom-type-deffault" section_id="ecom-yja6zr32yl"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">The Phoenix Gravity is one of the most advanced filtration systems on the market. With a Phoenix Gravity System, your water is purified through three-stages of activated carbon filtration to remove 99.9% of contaminants including bacteria, parasites, cysts, pesticides, heavy metals and more.&nbsp; This means we can trap physical contaminants that are more than 20 times smaller than jug filters. Combined with our higher filtration contact time we are 20 times more powerful than typical jug filters and those using granular carbon.<div><br></div><div>Our stainless steel chambers not only prevent microplastics and other harmful chemicals from leaching into your water, but also hold significantly more purified water than the average jug. This makes it even easier for you to enjoy fresh, nutrient-rich hydration - whenever you need it most. Unlike Reverse Osmosis (RO) filters, the gravity system does not require electricity to run or a plumber to install - and it won’t strip your water of the healthy nutrients your body benefits from.<div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div> </div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div> </div></div> <div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-9mrowu6b269"><div class="ecom__element element__heading ecom-element ecom-html ec