 "textcontent_t3m7n6141aa_html": "<p>Time to Replace Your Cartridge?<\/p><p>You\u2019re right where you need to be.<\/p><p>Meet the Phoenix Smart Carbon Cartridges, powered by premium coconut shell\u2013based activated carbon, engineered to purify every drop with unmatched precision. It removes up to 99.99% of impurities, giving you water that\u2019s pure, crisp, and refreshing, just as nature intended.<\/p><p>For consistently flawless performance, replace your Phoenix Smart Carbon Cartridges every 12 months and keep your water as clean and vibrant as the day you first poured it.<\/p>",
