 "textcontent_s63y9322ro8_html": "<ul><li>We\u2019ve created our Smart Cartridges from activated carbon using the highest-grade coconut shells (CTC 60) to create a dense, porous structure that removes 99.99% of parasites, heavy metals, chemicals and other contaminants - without removing the nutrients your body needs.<\/li><li>Traps physical contaminants more than 20 times smaller than jug filters.<\/li><\/ul>",
 "textcontent_hki5ai1vfa_html": "<ul><li>Silver-impregnated to prevent bacteria growth keeping your water safer for longer.<\/li><li>Fuses natural force of gravity with the highest-grade environmentally-friendly materials for the most effective, sustainable and durable filtration on the market.<\/li><\/ul>",
 "view_more_text_e6nyvxh4m6c_html": "View more",
