 "headingtext_07442cuzgaa3_html": "The Phoenix Difference",
 "textcontent_3fn1exz7gxc_html": "\nDesigned and manufactured in-house. Advanced and sustainable drinking water filtration removing 99.99% contaminants whilst retaining 100% nutrients.",
 "headingtext_siluhb2rdu_html": "Ready To Experience Water, As It Should Be?",
 "buttoncontent_ox5hgyna7c_html": "Complete Purchase",
 "headingtext_boou9jta0p_html": "The Phoenix Gravity Water<div>Filter with Smart Carbon<\/div>",
 "headingtext_3e6fy3tch8n_html": "The Phoenix Gravity Water<div>&nbsp;Filter with Smart Carbon + Fluoride Removal<div><div><\/div><\/div><\/div>",
 "headingtext_rx2nnd6b3tr_html": "The Phoenix Gravity Water Filter with Smart Carbon + Fluoride Removal + Teak Wood Stand<div><div><\/div><\/div>",
 "headingtext_ojwd1psj9as_html": "FAQs",
 "item_title_0_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Are the activated carbon cartridges compatible with all gravity filters or just the \nPhoenix Gravity Filter?",
 "item_title_1_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Can I set it up myself?",
 "item_title_2_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Can I clean my carbon cartridges?",
 "item_title_3_obyhwb3w3en_html": "How does the Phoenix Gravity Filter compare to plastic jugs or other filters?",
 "textcontent_2j78pjgtjlc_html": "Yes! Our advanced Carbon Cartridges are compatible with all gravity filters including Berkey and Doulton. If you\u2019re not sure about your filter, just drop us a line and we\u2019ll be happy to assist you&nbsp;<a href=\"\/pages\/contact-us\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\">contact here.<\/font><\/a><div><br><\/div>",
 "textcontent_srm4f5b4s5k_html": "Absolutely. The carbon cartridges are easy to replace on your own - without tools or a professional - and installed in your Phoenix Gravity System within minutes.&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>You simply remove the old cartridges from the upper chamber of your filter and replace them with the new. We\u2019ll send detailed assembly instructions with your new delivery - and our team is always available via chat, email and phone to provide help and support. <a href=\"\/pages\/contact-us\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\">Contact here<\/font><\/a><div><div><br><\/div><\/div><\/div>",
 "textcontent_6lqd35wz0ha_html": "Generally, you won\u2019t need to clean your cartridges - but they should be replaced within 18 months. If you notice the flow slows down, it may mean the cartridge is blocked. In this case, you can easily clean your filter in your home using tap water and a soft brush or mild abrasive. We\u2019ll include detailed instructions when we send it to you. <div><br><\/div>",
 "headingtext_9mrowu6b269_html": "Still have a burning question? See our full FAQs <a href=\"\/pages\/faq\">here.<\/a> ",
 "text0_s269ab745x_html": "If you don\u2019t like your water filter, within 100 days we\u2019ll give you a full refund.",
 "buttoncontent_gtwysirke4o_html": "Complete Purchase",
